<title>UK: LIFFE re-elects chairman, makes Clara Furse deputy.</title>
<headline>LIFFE re-elects chairman, makes Clara Furse deputy.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London International Financial Futures and Options Exchange (LIFFE) has re-elected Jack Wigglesworth as its chairman and chosen Clara Furse as his deputy.</p>
<p>LIFFE announced the appointments in a statement. Wigglesworth is also chairman of ABN AMRO Chicago Corp (UK) and has chaired LIFFE for two years after three years as the deputy chairman. Furse is global head of futures at UBS.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
